; 只用来生成 kernel32 的导入库（不用装 Windows SDK）；示例插件用得到的函数都在这张单子里
LIBRARY kernel32.dll
EXPORTS
GetModuleHandleW
GetModuleHandleExW
GetProcAddress
GetModuleFileNameW
DisableThreadLibraryCalls
CreateThread
CloseHandle
Sleep
GetTickCount64
GetLocalTime
GetFileAttributesW
CreateFileW
ReadFile
WriteFile
GetCurrentProcessId
CreateNamedPipeW
ConnectNamedPipe
DisconnectNamedPipe
PeekNamedPipe
GetLastError
AcquireSRWLockExclusive
ReleaseSRWLockExclusive
MoveFileExW
GetCurrentThreadId
